title Home Assistant: the phone scans the code and signs in: "Connected as deck", then Home (no favourite yet)
sizes 480x320 640x480 800x480 1024x600 1280x720 1280x800 720x720 480x800 480x640 800x1280
env HA_DEMO connect
env HA_DEMO_PHONE ok

wait 1700
shot connected-as
check connected-as
expect text "Connected as deck"
wait 2500
shot home-after-pairing
check home-after-pairing
expect text "Connected"
expect text "FAVOURITES"
expect text "No favourites yet"
expect text "ROOMS"
expect noquit
